## Where each one stands

#4471 closed on 5 October with two outcomes. They cover two of the three problems.

| problem | outcome | ticket |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `parser` | fixed: `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales` | closed (completed) |
| `hint` | won't fix: booking-v3 form retired | closed (not planned) |
| `one-day move` | nothing yet | **open** |

Closing #4471 did not close the one-day move. Neither fix touches it.

## Tickets filed

- parser — 379 reports
- hint — 33 reports
